DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
2178::$$$message_0011_0000_0000$$$::"Hiii, we're home!"[lr]::
2179::$$$message_0011_0000_0001$$$::"We're home, Shirou."[lr]::
2180::$$$message_0011_0000_0002$$$::"Hey, welcome back."[lr]::
2181::$$$message_0011_0000_0003$$$::Our family glutton has returned.[lr]::
2182::$$$message_0011_0000_0004$$$::She's holding an unfamiliar paper bag.::
2183::$$$message_0011_0001_0000$$$::"We went to Shinto."[lr]::
2184::$$$message_0011_0001_0001$$$::"Yeah, it was worth taking Saber around town. Everyone gave us so much free stuff."[lr]::
2185::$$$message_0011_0001_0002$$$::"I bet you only took her to weird places again. You're so hopeless."::
2186::$$$message_0011_0002_0000$$$::"That's not very nice.[lr]::
2187::$$$message_0011_0002_0001$$$::It feels like everyone always gives Saber credit for everything good that happens, and blames me for all the bad stuff."::
2188::$$$message_0011_0003_0000$$$::"Hmph! Let's go, Saber.[lr]::
2189::$$$message_0011_0003_0001$$$::Shirou doesn't understand how girls think. Just leave him to clean the house until the sun goes down."[lr]::
2190::$$$message_0011_0003_0002$$$::"Um, Taiga... Shirou? We're, um..."::
2191::$$$message_0011_0004_0000$$$::"...It's fine. I wonder what you did in Shinto, though."[lr]::
2192::$$$message_0011_0004_0001$$$::I'm curious about the paper bag.[lr]::
2193::$$$message_0011_0004_0002$$$::Should I coyly try to find out once I finish cleaning the entrance...?::
2194::$$$message_0011_0005_0000$$$::"If I'm going to interrogate her, this is what I need, yeah."[lr]::
2195::$$$message_0011_0005_0001$$$::I would place three enticing gifts on the bare desk: a pork cutlet bowl, a freshwater eel bowl, and ramen.[lr]::
2196::$$$message_0011_0005_0002$$$::But lunch is long over, so I prepare some tea and chocolate truffles instead.::
2197::$$$message_0011_0006_0000$$$::Those two probably went off to Saber's room.[lr]::
2198::$$$message_0011_0006_0001$$$::I heard them making noise in the hallway.::
2199::$$$message_0011_0007_0000$$$::"We're home!"[lr]::
2200::$$$message_0011_0007_0001$$$::"Excuse us."[lr]::
2201::$$$message_0011_0007_0002$$$::Oh, Rider and Sakura are back.[lr]::
2202::$$$message_0011_0007_0003$$$::I didn't make enough tea for everyone... I'll just have to make Sakura and Rider's share afterward.::
2203::$$$message_0011_0008_0000$$$::"Hey you two, I made tea!"[lr]::
2204::$$$message_0011_0008_0001$$$::I move fast.[lr]::
2205::$$$message_0011_0008_0002$$$::Just like always, I slip into the room and close the door.::
2206::$$$message_0011_0009_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
2207::$$$message_0011_0009_0001$$$::It's practically a miracle that I don't drop the tray.::
2208::$$$message_0011_0010_0000$$$::"...Um. Sorry, Saber. My bad."[lr]::
2209::$$$message_0011_0010_0001$$$::My paralyzed brain reacts mechanically.[lr]::
2210::$$$message_0011_0010_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
2211::$$$message_0011_0010_0003$$$::I try not to drop the tray.[lr]::
2212::$$$message_0011_0010_0004$$$::I reach for the door as calmly as possible.::
2213::$$$message_0011_0011_0000$$$::"I should've knocked. I'll leave now."[lr]::
2214::$$$message_0011_0011_0001$$$::"Please wait. Um...[lr]::
2215::$$$message_0011_0011_0002$$$::...I was about to put on a swimsuit."::
2216::$$$message_0011_0012_0000$$$::"We went to Shinto today to shop for a swimsuit.[lr]::
2217::$$$message_0011_0012_0001$$$::Taiga took me to see many shops, and the clerks complimented how I looked... But I'm still not confident and want to see how I really look."::
2218::$$$message_0011_0013_0000$$$::"O-oh. Well, sorry to interrupt. I'll be sure to knock next time[line len=2]"[lr]::
2219::$$$message_0011_0013_0001$$$::"So...[lr]::
2220::$$$message_0011_0013_0002$$$::I wanted you to see how I look in it, too."[lr]::
2221::$$$message_0011_0013_0003$$$::"Oh... Ohhh, okay. Well, let me know once you finish changing...!"::
902203::$$$message_9011_0008_0000$$$::"Hey you two, I made tea!"[r]::

